Package: mailflag
Version: 0.14.3~beta1
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MailFlag Local Build <local@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, libsecret-tools, xdg-utils
Recommends: libnotify-bin, pulseaudio-utils
Description: Fast multi-account Yahoo mail and OTP notifier
 MailFlag monitors Yahoo IMAP accounts, displays ordinary-mail and OTP
 popups, and safely performs exact-message actions using UIDVALIDITY and UID.
 The compatible imap-tools 1.15.0 runtime is bundled with the package.
